# Billing UI density (Adagu scale)

Match the compact operational density used on Adagu Bill and billing POS. Source of truth: `.billing-shell` and `.adagu-*` in `src/index.css`.

## Tokens on `.billing-shell`

Reuse these variables; do not invent new sizes for dense screens:

| Token | Value | Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `--billing-font-page` | `1.0625rem` | Page title (`h1`) |
| `--billing-font-section` | `0.875rem` | Card/section titles (`h2`) |
| `--billing-font-body` | `0.8125rem` | Inputs, buttons, body, chrome tabs |
| `--billing-font-label` | `0.6875rem` | Field labels, muted card subtitles |
| `--billing-control-h` | `2rem` | Input/select min-height |
| `--billing-icon-box` | `1.75rem`–`2rem` | Header/card icon boxes |
| `--billing-card-pad` | `1rem` | Card padding |
| `--billing-gap` | `0.75rem` | Section/card/grid gaps |
| `--billing-radius-control` | `0.5rem` | Controls |

## Layout habits

- Content padding with billing shell: `1rem 1.25rem` (`.content:has(.billing-shell)`)
- Cards: `padding: 1rem`, `gap: 0.75rem`, `border-radius: var(--radius)`, light shadow
- Fields: label above control, `gap: 0.25rem`; labels `font-weight: 600`
- Buttons: `font-size: 0.8125rem`, `padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem`
- Inputs: `font-size: 0.8125rem`, `padding: 0.375rem 0.625rem`, ~`2rem` tall
- Wrap new dense pages in `billing-shell` so tokens apply instead of one-off rem values
- Do not use app-default `1.5rem` page titles or `1.5rem 2rem` content padding on form/editor screens

## Do / don't

- **Do** use `--billing-*` tokens or the rem values above
- **Don't** use large dashboard density (`1.5rem` titles, `1.25rem+` card padding) on operational pages unless the page is marketing/hero
- **Don't** rename Adagu-specific classes unless refactoring into a shared shell
